WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.662
Before the stages, a short primer,
because every later slide leans on it.

2
00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:08.037
In AD, where an object
sits does half the work.

3
00:00:08.037 --> 00:00:12.274
In Entra ID, what the object says
about itself has to do all of it.

4
00:00:12.274 --> 00:00:16.900
The directory is flat, the schema is
fixed, and you reach it through Graph.

5
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.625
Write control moves to roles
scoped by administrative units.

6
00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:25.912
And the row that shapes everything
is the last one: for synced users,

7
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:31.488
AD still masters most attributes, so
edit them in AD or HR, not in Entra ID.

8
00:00:31.488 --> 00:00:33.460
Now the attributes themselves.
